---
import { getCase } from '../data/cases';
import { withBase } from '../lib/urls';
interface Props {slug:string;}
const {slug}=Astro.props;const d=getCase(slug);
---
<div data-comparison><div class="comparison-labels"><strong>Before / equal-weight actions</strong><strong>After / a clear next step</strong></div><div class="before-after" data-before-after><div class="layer"><img src={withBase(`media/${slug}-before-1280.webp`)} width="1280" height="960" loading="lazy" alt={`${d.name} starting concept: ${d.before.join(', ')}`}/></div><div class="layer after"><img src={withBase(`media/${slug}-1280.webp`)} width="1280" height="960" loading="lazy" alt={`${d.name} redesigned concept: ${d.after.join(', ')}`}/></div><div class="comparison-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="comparison-controls" data-enhancement hidden role="group" aria-label="Compare the concept interfaces"><button class="filter-btn" type="button" data-compare-value="0" aria-pressed="false">Before</button><button class="filter-btn" type="button" data-compare-value="50" aria-pressed="true">Compare</button><button class="filter-btn" type="button" data-compare-value="100" aria-pressed="false">After</button><label class="sr-only" for={`compare-${slug}`}>Reveal redesigned interface</label><input id={`compare-${slug}`} type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" value="50" aria-valuetext="Half of each interface"/></div><p class="status" data-compare-status>Compare the original concept and the redesigned concept.</p><details><summary>Comparison explained without dragging</summary><p><strong>Before:</strong> {d.before.join(' → ')}.</p><p><strong>After:</strong> {d.after.join(' → ')}.</p><p>These are original concept reconstructions, not screenshots from a client product. <a href={withBase(`media/${slug}-before-1280.webp`)}>Open the full before image</a> or <a href={withBase(`media/${slug}-1280.webp`)}>open the full after image</a>.</p></details></div>
